// The node view (`cadrs_app::node_view`): the feature list as a node graph, with a
// configuration. `blocks 2`: two blocks, each a sketch and a New extrude.
// 01 The node view: the feature panel widened into a canvas with the schematic's grid; each
//    feature a node (an extrude's node its dialog), geometry wires from sketches into extrudes,
//    each node's output row, and the Parts node on the right.
// 02 Add configuration, + Input: the Configuration node with presets and an input `input1`.
// 03 The input's socket dragged onto the first extrude's Depth: Depth reads #input1 and the
//    block is 10 mm tall; a grey wire from the input to the field.
// 04 + Preset: Preset 2, active, in the node and in the features header.
// 05 Presets table: every preset's value of `input1` side by side in the Configuration node.
// 06 Auto arrange: laid out again and framed.
// 07 Back to the list: the feature list, narrow again, with the preset dropdown.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("blocks 2"),
        Click(ui("feature-node-view")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("01-node-view"),
        Click(ui("node-configure")),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("node-input-add")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("02-input"),
        Drag(ui("node-input-input1-out"), ui("node-extrude-1-depth")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("03-wired"),
        Click(ui("node-preset-add")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("04-preset"),
        Click(ui("node-presets-table")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("05-table"),
        Click(ui("node-canvas-arrange")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("06-arranged"),
        Click(ui("feature-node-view")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("07-list"),
    ],
)
